\title{Fixed field}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2023-10-01}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{If #{S \subset \operatorname{Aut}(L)} is any subset we define the \em{fixed field} of #{S} to be}

##{L^S = \lbrace x \in L : \sigma(x) = x \; \forall \sigma \in S\rbrace .}

\p{This is a subfield of #{L} (exercise).}
